# Opportunity Scan — Source of Truth

Find, check, and track opportunities for **FairBanks / FCHIP**. Every listing must be open to Ugandans.

## Main deliverables

| What | Path |
|---|---|
| Working tracker | `opportunities/tracker.xlsx` |
| New-scan workbook | `opportunities/new_opportunities.xlsx` |
| Simpler.Grants.gov scan | `opportunities/new_grants.xlsx` |
| Scan rebuild | `opportunities/build_new_grants.py` |

**Working tracker** = shortlist + Application / Submission status and `applications/` links. One file — no drafts.

**New-scan** = fresh crawl (same columns). Does not replace the tracker; promote strong fits when you act.

**new_grants.xlsx** = live [Simpler.Grants.gov](https://simpler.grants.gov) Health grants FairBanks can apply for (Ugandan private company, women-led, Community Reach + FCHIP). Sorted by earliest deadline. Built by `build_new_grants.py`.

## Excel layout

**Sheet 1: Opportunities** — columns in this order:

| Column | Details |
|---|---|
| Project Title | Official or common programme name |
| URL | Direct link to the official call |
| Brief Description | Clear English, max 100 words: goal, eligibility, FairBanks fit |
| Application Deadline | Exact date (e.g. `31 July 2026`) or `Rolling` |
| Gender Category | One of the options below |
| Application Status | e.g. Not started, Drafting, Submitted, Complete |
| Submission Status | Submitted, rejected, awarded, or unknown |
| Submission Date | Date submitted; blank if not yet |
| Application Folder | `applications/{slug}` when a pack exists; else blank |

**Sheet 2: Scan Notes** — sources, date, approach, exclusions, gender counts, priority-soon.

**Sheet 3 (new-scan / grants): Fit Summary** — FairBanks fit triage.

### Sorting

Soonest deadline first; unknown or rolling last. Keep green / blue / red highlights.

## Gender category — use one only

- **Gender-based (women/girls):** women, girls, or women-led (e.g. AWIEF).
- **Multi-gender (all genders):** open to everyone.

## Eligibility — Uganda focus

Include only if still open and Ugandans can apply (global, Africa, East Africa, or Uganda). Exclude Uganda-blocked, unfit, or closed calls unless asked to archive; note why in Scan Notes.

## How to scan

Verify eligibility and deadlines on listing **and** funder pages. Aggregators need the official funder page before apply.

## What's a good fit?

Community health intelligence, CHW/VHT, digital health, prediction, maternal/child; women-led deep tech; health systems; AI-for-good, GovTech, climate–health, DPI / safeguards. Keep okay fits even if indirect.

