## Before submitting an update

- Descriptions ≤ 100 words; deadlines accurate.
- No closed/ineligible rows unless asked to keep.
- Every row has a gender category; submitted rows have date + Application Folder when a pack exists.
- Close Excel if the file is locked.

## Application packs

When a call becomes a pack under `applications/`, follow `.cursor/rules/documents.mdc` and `folder_structure.mdc`. Set **Application Folder** on the working tracker.
